 {"term": "Eikasia", "def": "Imagining or guessing: the lowest state of mind on the divided line, concerned with images."},
 {"term": "Eros", "def": "Greek for desiring love; in the Symposium, the love that climbs from beautiful bodies to Beauty itself."},
